MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=1
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DESCRIPTION<<PROMOTE_DESC_END
4.1.0: Minor release — P0–P2 contract integration, identity/auth subsystem, ASM ABI hardening, and Replit support.

Memory (kernel/core/memory/): fl_stack free-frame pool for PMM; fl_exec_context
snapshot (heap/stack/IP/registers); fl_result_t on fallible PMM APIs.

Time (kernel/core/time/): fl_timekeeping via POSIX CLOCK_MONOTONIC (P1-7 hosted path).

Identity (kernel/core/identity/): SQLite user_db with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 password
hashes (OpenSSL); login/logout/su/sudo/sudo -i/sudo -k/whoami/useradd/userdel/passwd
shell commands; session_login_env HOME/cwd apply on su -/sudo -i; elevation pool of
16 slots; tcgetattr password prompts; db->loaded guard; userdel hash/salt zero;
useradd fl_user_db_next_uid; guest privileged-op deny; audit grant/revoke lines.

Jail (P0 FS): fs_jail elevation-aware; elevated or sudo required to escape VM jail.

Authz (P2-3): fm_service write_chain gates on create/move; FL_AUTHZ_OP_IDENTITY_*
shell→subsystem mapping; test_p0_p2_wiring covers stack, PMM, exec_context, user_db,
path_property, timekeeping, and authz.

ASM (arch/*/gas/, arch/x86_64/nasm/): fl_stack_asm push/pop/count hot paths and
fl_elevation_active_count slot scan; _Static_assert slot layout (56 bytes);
ABI fixes — malloc_nolock callee-saved registers, AArch64 free mov x19 before
lock_acquire, AAPCS64 16-byte frames, cld, lock release; x86-64 realloc via
asm_mem_copy; NASM .note.GNU-stack noalloc/noexec/nowrite; alloc .hidden;
shell_history_host_asm cmp order; disk_host_io NASM; kernel asm sync;
legacy ARM/ and x86-64 (NASM)/ root trees removed.

Replit: .replit, replit.nix, replit.md, docs/replit.md, flake.nix, nix/deps.json
for https://replit.com/~ GitHub import; Replit Agent rules aligned with CLAUDE.md,
AGENTS.md, .cursor/rules/, and .coderabbit.yaml.

CI/Makefile: AArch64 cross-build with fetch-openssl-aarch64.sh and
fetch-sqlite-aarch64.sh; SHA-256 checksum verification for fetched deps;
persist-credentials: false on CI checkouts; sync-version-checkout GITHUB_TOKEN
remote URL and overlay mode; test_p0_p2_wiring added to .gitignore.

Contracts: contract_p0_fs_jail.h; contract_p2_authz; contract_p2_credential_store;
FL_CONTRACT_P2_IDENTITY_REV 3; P0–P2 ROADMAP integration column updated.

Docs: docs/p0_p2_pr_coverage.md; MIGRATION_GUIDE status rows updated to ✅;
docs/ARCH.md ARCH=arm = AArch64 clarification; NASM-SYNC-001 closed.
VER_4_1_0_GM1_DEV4
PROMOTE_DESC_END

RELEASE_DATE=2026-05-23
